er, system setup, user training, and support. Securely move training materials, minimize downtime. Trust us for a smooth transition and focus on delivering quality training.\",\"_items_1_description\":\"field_697b9b752afd7\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6976774a6876a\",\"items_2_image\":577,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697677596876b\",\"items_2_title\":\"LMS Administration:\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_697b9b6d2afd6\",\"items_2_description\":\"Our administrators, skilled in leveraging the latest technologies and best practices, offer various plans including part-time, full-time, and unlimited LMS assistance. This ensures all your training needs and LMS requirements are comprehensively addressed\",\"_items_2_description\":\"field_697b9b752afd7\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_697b9b472afd5\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"How We Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our process is collaborative and transparent. We start by thoroughly understanding your objectives and then work closely with you to design, develop, and deploy a custom learning solution that exceeds your expectations.\\r\\n\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":581,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6 my-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6 my-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-4\"><strong>Our Learning Expertise</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Ninja Tropic, we’re obsessed with creating user-friendly learning experiences that drive measurable results. Our team combines industry-leading instructional design practices with user experience (UX) expertise to ensure your training is not only engaging but also effective.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We focus on developing clear learning objectives, designing interactive activities, and providing ongoing assessments to measure knowledge gain and skill development. We believe that learning should be enjoyable and measurable, and our custom solutions are designed to deliver both.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":583,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/BLOG_111__ILU_2__10_Types_of_Corporate_Training_Programs_and_Uses_in_the_Workplace_BLO_101-2-1024x454.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-583\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"mt-6 pt-6 pb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mt-6 pt-6 pb-4\"><strong><em>eLearning </em> Case Studies</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container my-4 py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container my-4 py-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":590,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Wonderful.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-590\" style=\"width:auto;height:400px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Wonderful Company<br><strong><small>Character Animation + Illustrative Animation</small></strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Wonderful Company sought an inclusive, engaging safety eLearning solution. Faced with diverse employees and critical equipment operation needs, they turned to Ninja Tropic.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our custom, interactive video learning solutions, featuring engaging animated characters and multi-language capabilities, were the perfect fit. Discover the results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Read more!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"container my-4 py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center container my-4 py-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"66.66%\",\"className\":\"container \"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University<br><strong><small><strong><small>Motion Comics</small></strong><br></small></strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical students grapple with complex health sciences. Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi from Indiana University sought an innovative solution.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our interactive ICU simulation game brought the subject to life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn how this life-saving learning experience was created.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Read more!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":599,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/indiana.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-599\" style=\"width:auto;height:400px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container my-4 py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container my-4 py-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":598,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"400px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Autodesk.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-598\" style=\"width:auto;height:400px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Autodesk<br><strong><small><strong><small>Live Action + Infographics</small></strong></small></strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sales is fast-paced. Autodesk needed to quickly onboard their sales team on a new product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ninja Tropic created engaging microlearning videos with strong visuals and clear explanations.Discover how we helped Autodesk achieve sales success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Read more!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Learning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','333-revision-v1','','','2026-02-23 03:21:29','2026-02-23 03:21:29','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?p=602',0,'revision','',0),(604,1,'2026-02-23 14:32:53','2026-02-23 14:32:53','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch1\\u003eCustom Learning Solutions\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\