 policy updates, and product knowledge training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Gamification:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe in the power of gamification to enhance learning experiences. Our gamified content incorporates points, badges, and leaderboards to motivate learners and track progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Custom Assessments:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer custom assessments tailored to your specific training goals, with a variety of question types to measure knowledge retention and application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"cotainer py-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center cotainer py-4\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our <em>mobile Learning </em>Features</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Responsive Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content adapts to any screen size, so your employees get the best experience on their device of choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Bite Sized Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We break down complex topics into short, easy-to-digest modules, perfect for quick learning on the go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 HTML5:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content is built using HTML5, ensuring compatibility across all modern browsers and devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Interactive Design:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use interactive elements to keep learners engaged and actively involved in the training process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Custom Mobile Learning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','337-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 02:12:17','2026-03-07 02:12:17','',337,'http://localhost:8080/?p=679',0,'revision','',0),(680,1,'2026-03-07 02:12:34','2026-03-07 02:12:34','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Mobile learning solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Mobile learning is no longer a “nice-to-have.” It’s a must-have business learning solution. It’s the key to unlocking a more engaged, effective, and efficient workforce. And with Ninja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions, you can harness the power of interactive video to deliver training that truly resonates.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":657,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_r