ong><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-portfolio/\"><em>award-winning portfolio</em></a></strong> and<br>explore the endless possibilities of microlearning 👈</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related</strong><em><strong> Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Custom Mobile Learning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','337-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 13:50:21','2026-03-07 13:50:21','',337,'http://localhost:8080/?p=696',0,'revision','',0),(697,1,'2026-03-07 13:50:44','2026-03-07 13:50:44','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Mobile learning solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Mobile learning is no longer a “nice-to-have.” It’s a must-have business learning solution. It’s the key to unlocking a more engaged, effective, and efficient workforce. And with Ninja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions, you can harness the power of interactive video to deliver training that truly resonates.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":657,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhat is Mobile Learning?\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n“\\u003cstrong\\u003eMobile\\u003c/strong\\u003e” simply means accessible on a smartphone, tablet or mobile device. “Mobile learning” is the delivery of formal training content through these devices. This could be through interactive videos, quizzes, or even augmented reality experiences. Ninja Tropic specializes in creating custom mobile learning solutions tailored to your specific needs and goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Why mobile learning?\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Mobile learning offers unparalleled flexibility and convenience. Your employees can access training materials anytime, anywhere, on any mobile device. This is a game-changer, particularly for remote or deskless teams. Mobile learning also boosts engagement through bite-sized modules and interactive elements, making learning more enjoyable and effective.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":664,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Your <em>Mobile Learning</em> Strategy</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We believe in a collaborative approach. We work closely with you to understand your organization’s unique needs and goals. This allows us to develop a mobile learning strategy that aligns with your overall training strategy and delivers measurable results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eTraining Needs Analysis:\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis:\\r\\nSeamlessly integrate our courses into your existing learning management system (LMS) for easy deployment and tracking.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eLearning Experience Planning:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Next, we craft a mobile friendly learning experience that’s both engaging and effective. We define clear learning objectives, map out the user journey, and select the best content types (videos, quizzes, etc.). We also plan assessments to measure progress. This ensures your learners stay focused and motivated on their mobile friendly training program.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":669,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eContent Production and Curation:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Now, we bring your vision to life. We create captivating, interactive content, or repurpose your existing materials for mobile delivery. We develop quizzes and tests to reinforce the learning experience and ensure everything is accurate and up-to-date.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":668,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eMedia Development and Testing:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Finally, we package everything for a smooth mobile experience. We optimize content for different devices, load it onto your platform, and thoroughly test it. Your custom mobile learning program is ready for launch, and we’ll monitor its performance to make sure it’s a success.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a quote</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What <em>We Offer</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic offers a comprehensive suite of custom mobile learning solutions tailored to your specific needs. Our expertise lies in creating engaging and effective learning experiences that drive results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Interactive Videos:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We specialize in interactive videos that bring training to life. Our mobile friendly videos can be used for product demonstrations, training simulations, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Bite-Sized Microlearning:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We create bite-sized microlearning modules that are perfect for quick learning on the go. These modules can be used for skills refreshers, new policy updates, and product knowledge training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Gamification:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe in the power of gamification to enhance learning experiences. Our gamified content incorporates points, badges, and leaderboards to motivate learners and track progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Custom Assessments:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer custom assessments tailored to your specific training goals, with a variety of question types to measure knowledge retention and application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container py-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container py-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"cotainer py-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center cotainer py-4\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our <em>mobile Learning </em>Features</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Responsive Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content adapts to any screen size, so your employees get the best experience on their device of choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Bite Sized Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We break down complex topics into short, easy-to-digest modules, perfect for quick learning on the go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 HTML5:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content is built using HTML5, ensuring compatibility across all modern browsers and devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Interactive Design:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use interactive elements to keep learners engaged and actively involved in the training process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a quote</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\