o/\"><em>award-winning portfolio</em></a></strong> and<br>explore the endless possibilities of microlearning 👈</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"96px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:96px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Mobile Learning Awards\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_31 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions have earned accolades from prestigious organizations like Brandon Hall, eLearning Industry, and Health Information Awards. Our award-winning designs prioritize personalized learning experiences that adapt to each user’s learning needs. This approach keeps learners engaged on their mobile devices, leading to better knowledge retention and on-the-job performance support. Whether it’s a mobile-friendly microlearning module or a comprehensive mobile training method, our solutions are tailored to meet your organization’s specific goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"