w\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ready to [gradient]start developing[/gradient] your learner’s Training experience?\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Discover the power of video training animation by scheduling a FREE consultation with one of our Ninja Tropic experts\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Homepage','','inherit','closed','closed','','301-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 14:19:10','2026-03-07 14:19:10','',301,'http://localhost:8080/?p=718',0,'revision','',0),(719,1,'2026-03-07 14:20:37','2026-03-07 14:20:37','','BlogILU_47_Blo4-4-4','','inherit','open','closed','','blogilu_47_blo4-4-4','','','2026-03-07 14:20:37','2026-03-07 14:20:37','',343,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/BlogILU_47_Blo4-4-4.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(721,1,'2026-03-07 14:26:51','2026-03-07 14:26:51','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eUnleash the Power of Interactive Video for Your E-Learning Content\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"In today’s digital world, competition for attention is fierce. With so many options for education and entertainment at our fingertips, it can be difficult to stand out and engage your target audience. The key to success is creating an e-learning product that is not only educational but also enjoyable and easy to use. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we understand this challenge and have developed a unique approach to help our clients monetize their content and build a product that truly stands out.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":719,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur Approach to Content Monetization\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our focus is on creating an end-to-end user experience that seamlessly combines education and commerce. We understand that traditional e-learning platforms may not be accessible or familiar to everyone, so we design our solutions to be easy to use and engage your audience from the very start.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis not only helps increase adoption but also maximizes your revenue potential. Our approach to content monetization is about more than just selling access to information, it’s about creating a product that people will be excited to pay for because they see the value in what you’re offering.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Steps to Conduct a <em>Training Needs Analysis</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container pt-3 pb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container pt-3 pb-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The following are the steps involved in conducting a TNA:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>🔸 Identify the Business Goals: Start by understanding the organization’s goals and objectives. This step involves assessing how training fits into the larger picture and the role it plays in achieving the organization’s goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Assess the Audience: In this step, you’ll need to assess the target audience. This involves identifying who will be taking the training, their current skills and knowledge levels, learning preferences, and motivations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Determine the Gap: With a clear understanding of the business goals and the audience, you can determine the gap between the two. This step involves identifying the skills and knowledge that the learners need to achieve the organization’s objectives.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Choose the Appropriate Method: There are several methods for conducting a TNA, including surveys, focus groups, and observation. Choose the method that is most suitable for your organization and audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Evaluate the Results: Once you’ve collected the data, it’s time to evaluate the results. This step involves identifying areas for improvement and determining the training necessary to address the identified gaps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Create the Training Plan: With the results of the TNA in hand, you can create a comprehensive training plan. The plan should include the content and format of the training, delivery method, and evaluation criteria.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"mb-2\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center mb-2\">By conducting a TNA, you can ensure that your e-learning content is targeted, relevant, and effective. TNA is a powerful tool for unlocking the potential of your e-learning content and driving results for your organization. The following are the benefits of conducting a TNA: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Targeted and Relevant Content: TNA helps in identifying the skills and knowledge gaps of the target audience, ensuring that the e-learning content is tailored to meet their specific needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Increased Engagement: By creating e-learning content that is relevant and targeted, you can increase engagement and participation levels among the target audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Better Learning Outcomes: With TNA, you can create e-learning content that addresses the specific learning needs of the audience, leading to better learning outcomes and long-lasting impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Improved Organizational Performance: TNA helps in identifying the skills and knowledge required to achieve the organization’s goals, leading to improved organizational performance and increased competitiveness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Learn more about the  [gradient]raining Needs Analysis[/gradient] on a Free Consultation\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis is a crucial step in the creation of effective e-learning content. Embrace the power of TNA and take your e-learning content to the next level. Start inspiring behavior change and drive results for your organization today.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','eLearning Content Monetization | Ninja Tropic Media','','inherit','closed','closed','','343-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 14:26:51','2026-03-07 14:26:51','',343,'http://localhost:8080/?p=721',0,'revision','',0),(722,1,'2026-03-07 14:28:06','2026-03-07 14:28:06','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eUnleash the Power of Interactive Video for Your E-Learning Content\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"In today’s digital world, com