nd Interactive Learning</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Blended eLearning Solutions | Ninja Tropic','','inherit','closed','closed','','345-revision-v1','','','2026-03-07 14:59:27','2026-03-07 14:59:27','',345,'http://localhost:8080/?p=743',0,'revision','',0),(744,1,'2026-03-07 14:59:33','2026-03-07 14:59:33','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBlended eLearning Solutions – Modern User Experience\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nCombining the best of both worlds, in-person instruction with a side of eLearning has the ability to provide interaction with an extremely effective follow-up for content retention. Reaching those who prefer something a bit more structured to those who want the freedom to learn when they can focus their time on the material, blended learning engages them all.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":728,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"fiel