ate({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Homepage','','inherit','closed','closed','','301-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:11:19','2026-03-12 03:11:19','',301,'http://localhost:8080/?p=838',0,'revision','',0),(839,1,'2026-03-12 03:29:33','2026-03-12 03:29:33','','Educational-Training_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-5-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','educational-training_mesa-de-trabajo-1-5-copia','','','2026-03-12 03:29:33','2026-03-12 03:29:33','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Educational-Training_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-5-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(841,1,'2026-03-12 03:30:07','2026-03-12 03:30:07','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:30:07','2026-03-12 03:30:07','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=841',0,'revision','',0),(842,1,'2026-03-12 03:32:51','2026-03-12 03:32:51','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Our <em>Process</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container pt-2 pb-4 px-2\">Our process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:32:51','2026-03-12 03:32:51','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=842',0,'revision','',0),(843,1,'2026-03-12 03:36:31','2026-03-12 03:36:31','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:36:31','2026-03-12 03:36:31','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=843',0,'revision','',0),(844,1,'2026-03-12 03:36:57','2026-03-12 03:36:57','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:36:57','2026-03-12 03:36:57','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=844',0,'revision','',0),(845,1,'2026-03-12 03:37:16','2026-03-12 03:37:16','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:37:16','2026-03-12 03:37:16','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=845',0,'revision','',0),(846,1,'2026-03-12 03:37:35','2026-03-12 03:37:35','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:37:35','2026-03-12 03:37:35','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=846',0,'revision','',0),(847,1,'2026-03-12 03:38:36','2026-03-12 03:38:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:38:36','2026-03-12 03:38:36','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=847',0,'revision','',0),(848,1,'2026-03-12 03:40:10','2026-03-12 03:40:10','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check our customer success stories!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\">Related <em>Solutions</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:40:10','2026-03-12 03:40:10','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=848',0,'revision','',0),(849,1,'2026-03-12 03:40:23','2026-03-12 03:40:23','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Services\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Organizations need training solutions that truly work. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, our instructional design services deliver measurable results. Our focus is on building experiences that resonate with modern learners—training that isn’t just content, but drives knowledge, attitudes, and skills. Whether you’re looking to develop a new training program or improve existing content, our team is here to help.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":528,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eExperiential Learning\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nThe best learning happens through experience. That’s why we incorporate hands-on, experiential learning into all our solutions. Learners don’t just sit back and watch—they interact, practice, and apply skills in real scenarios. This approach builds competency that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Leaders in Creativity (and the portfolio to back it up!)\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\u0022font-size: 1rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\\u0022\\u003eCreativity is at the heart of everything we do. We don’t settle for cookie-cutter designs. Instead, we bring your training to life with innovative, engaging methods that captivate learners. We have the largest portfolio of dynamic learning experiences in the industry, ensuring that we can tailor our solutions to meet your specific needs. Whether it’s through storytelling, gamification, or interactive media, we make learning exciting.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 learning-services\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0 et_clickable et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_blurb_content\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_main_blurb_image\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Employee Onboarding \\u0026 Engagement\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":142,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Customer Training \\u0026 Product Knowledge\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":143,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"Association \\u0026 Nonprofit Course Development\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":144,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_3_tag\":\"\",\"_items_3_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_3_title\":\"Patient Education\",\"_items_3_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_3_image\":146,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_4_tag\":\"\",\"_items_4_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_4_title\":\"Safety Training\",\"_items_4_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_4_image\":147,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_5_tag\":\"\",\"_items_5_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_5_title\":\"Software Training\",\"_items_5_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_5_image\":148,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022 style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003e Process\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003eOur process is designed to drive behavior change and build competency by focusing on attitude, knowledge, and skills. We start with a thorough needs analysis to identify performance gaps and define a customized learning path. Our content is scripted for modern learners, using engaging media and real-world scenarios that resonate. Every step of our approach is crafted to inspire measurable improvements, ensuring the training aligns with business goals and delivers lasting impact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style=\\u0022text-align: center;\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container mb-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Needs Analysis/ Assessments</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every successful training program begins with a deep understanding of what’s needed. We start with a thorough needs analysis, identifying gaps in knowledge and skills. From there, we align your training objectives with business outcomes, ensuring your training drives real results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Curriculum Analysis &amp; Design</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Content Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great training needs great content. We specialize in developing rich, engaging content that meets learners where they are. Whether it’s video, interactive modules, or written materials, we create content that’s easy to follow and highly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Course Design &amp; Development</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Course development is more than putting information into slides. We hate slide based learning experiences as much as your learners do. It’s about creating an immersive learning experience that engages and motivates learners. We develop courses that are interactive, learner-centered, and aligned with best practices in instructional design.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":630,\"aspectRatio\":\"9/16\",\"scale\":\"cover\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Our-Process-vertical-1280x1839-1-713x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-630\" style=\"aspect-ratio:9/16;object-fit:cover\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container py-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container py-6\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":636,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Design-FAQ-1280x720-1-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-636\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Design FAQ</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What does eLearning typically cost?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The cost of eLearning can vary depending on the complexity and length of the content. We offer flexible pricing to match your training needs, whether you’re looking for a simpleonline&nbsp; course or a fully immersive, multimedia experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a cost leader in the industry, we’ve been able to provide exceptional value to our clients by leveraging our experience working with service associations, nonprofits, and as a backend studio to major agencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission-driven approach ensures that we are committed to providing high-quality, affordable training solutions. For an hour of content, our prices typically range from $7,000 to $24,000 depending on the style and complexity of the online course.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What makes a good design for learning?</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A good learning design is one that’s learner-centered, engaging, and results-driven. It should focus on practical applications, ensuring that learners can apply their knowledge and skills in real-world settings. Learning has to shift attitudes and inspire behavior change. Slides-based learning modules or poorly put together content do not communicate a positive message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\"><em><strong>Case studies</strong><br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We’ve worked with organizations across industries to deliver results-driven instructional design solutions. Our case studies showcase how we’ve helped companies achieve their training goals and improve performance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Check our customer success stories!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container mt-6 mb-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container mt-6 mb-4\">Related <em>Solutions</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"If you’re ready to take your training to the next level with an award-winning instructional design company, let’s talk. \\u003cstrong\\u003eContact us for a free consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and let’s create a solution that works for you.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Results Driven Instructional Design Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','335-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:40:23','2026-03-12 03:40:23','',335,'http://localhost:8080/?p=849',0,'revision','',0),(850,1,'2026-03-12 03:42:06','2026-03-12 03:42:06','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Mobile learning solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Mobile learning is no longer a “nice-to-have.” It’s a must-have business learning solution. It’s the key to unlocking a more engaged, effective, and efficient workforce. And with Ninja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions, you can harness the power of interactive video to deliver training that truly resonates.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":657,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhat is Mobile Learning?\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"“\\u003cstrong\\u003eMobile\\u003c/strong\\u003e” simply means accessible on a smartphone, tablet or mobile device. “Mobile learning” is the delivery of formal training content through these devices. This could be through interactive videos, quizzes, or even augmented reality experiences. Ninja Tropic specializes in creating custom mobile learning solutions tailored to your specific needs and goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Why mobile learning?\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Mobile learning offers unparalleled flexibility and convenience. Your employees can access training materials anytime, anywhere, on any mobile device. This is a game-changer, particularly for remote or deskless teams. Mobile learning also boosts engagement through bite-sized modules and interactive elements, making learning more enjoyable and effective.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":664,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Your <em>Mobile Learning</em> Strategy</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We believe in a collaborative approach. We work closely with you to understand your organization’s unique needs and goals. This allows us to develop a mobile learning strategy that aligns with your overall training strategy and delivers measurable results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eTraining Needs Analysis:\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Training Needs Analysis:\\r\\nSeamlessly integrate our courses into your existing learning management system (LMS) for easy deployment and tracking.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eLearning Experience Planning:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Next, we craft a mobile friendly learning experience that’s both engaging and effective. We define clear learning objectives, map out the user journey, and select the best content types (videos, quizzes, etc.). We also plan assessments to measure progress. This ensures your learners stay focused and motivated on their mobile friendly training program.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":669,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eContent Production and Curation:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Now, we bring your vision to life. We create captivating, interactive content, or repurpose your existing materials for mobile delivery. We develop quizzes and tests to reinforce the learning experience and ensure everything is accurate and up-to-date.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":668,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eMedia Development and Testing:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Finally, we package everything for a smooth mobile experience. We optimize content for different devices, load it onto your platform, and thoroughly test it. Your custom mobile learning program is ready for launch, and we’ll monitor its performance to make sure it’s a success.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":672,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a quote</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What <em>We Offer</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic offers a comprehensive suite of custom mobile learning solutions tailored to your specific needs. Our expertise lies in creating engaging and effective learning experiences that drive results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Interactive Videos:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We specialize in interactive videos that bring training to life. Our mobile friendly videos can be used for product demonstrations, training simulations, and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Bite-Sized Microlearning:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We create bite-sized microlearning modules that are perfect for quick learning on the go. These modules can be used for skills refreshers, new policy updates, and product knowledge training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Gamification:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe in the power of gamification to enhance learning experiences. Our gamified content incorporates points, badges, and leaderboards to motivate learners and track progress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Custom Assessments:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer custom assessments tailored to your specific training goals, with a variety of question types to measure knowledge retention and application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container py-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container py-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"cotainer py-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center cotainer py-4\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our <em>mobile Learning </em>Features</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Responsive Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content adapts to any screen size, so your employees get the best experience on their device of choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Bite Sized Learning:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We break down complex topics into short, easy-to-digest modules, perfect for quick learning on the go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 HTML5:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our content is built using HTML5, ensuring compatibility across all modern browsers and devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Interactive Design:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We use interactive elements to keep learners engaged and actively involved in the training process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a quote</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><em>Mobile Learning </em>Examples</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Patient Education:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Empower patients to manage their health with easy-to-understand information on a mobile device.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/KksGo0OWJyM\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Promote a safe workplace with engaging simulations and real-life scenarios.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Knowledge Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Equip employees with in-depth product information through interactive modules and quizzes.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HMFblIjGc2A\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Customer Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Enhance customer satisfaction with easy-to-follow product usage and troubleshooting guides.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/PhrLobrV6fQ\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skills Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Help employees upskill or reskill with targeted microlearning modules. Boost learner engagement!\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">👉 Dive into our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-portfolio/\"><em>award-winning portfolio</em></a></strong>&nbsp;and<br>explore the endless possibilities of microlearning 👈</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"96px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:96px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Mobile Learning Awards\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_31 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic’s custom mobile learning solutions have earned accolades from prestigious organizations like Brandon Hall, eLearning Industry, and Health Information Awards. Our award-winning designs prioritize personalized learning experiences that adapt to each user’s learning needs. This approach keeps learners engaged on their mobile devices, leading to better knowledge retention and on-the-job performance support. Whether it’s a mobile-friendly microlearning module or a comprehensive mobile training method, our solutions are tailored to meet your organization’s specific goals.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper et_pb_button_alignment_center et_pb_module et_had_animation\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"rojects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"industry sectors industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"96px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:96px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related</strong><em><strong> Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":643,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/57.-iconos-Compliance-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Compliance Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Compliance is crucial for business success. Engage employees with tailored training to foster a culture of compliance. A committed team equals a compliant company.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":644,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/66.-iconos-Product-Training-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Product Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals.&nbsp;Effective training boosts sales,&nbsp;improves customer satisfaction,&nbsp;and increases ROI.&nbsp;Make training engaging,&nbsp;not a chore.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":645,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/60.-iconos-Employee-onboarding-480x480-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-645\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Employee Onboarding</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Onboarding is more than just training.&nbsp;It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging.&nbsp;Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a [gradient]FREE Consultation[/gradient] With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your association, university, or enterprise’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Custom Mobile Learning Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','337-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:42:06','2026-03-12 03:42:06','',337,'http://localhost:8080/?p=850',0,'revision','',0),(851,1,'2026-03-12 03:45:05','2026-03-12 03:45:05','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:45:05','2026-03-12 03:45:05','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=851',0,'revision','',0),(852,1,'2026-03-13 03:55:37','2026-03-13 03:55:37','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eVideo Training Strategy\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you invest in your learners, the goal is a high return on that investment. Click-through slide decks and boring ready-made training modules just don’t deliver that return. Instead, insert an inventive and result-delivering video training strategy.\\r\\nVideo eLearning captures the attention of your learners, employees, and executives to drastically increase comprehension and implementation rates. Engagement is key to effectiveness and graphic video training is the solution.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":945,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Video Learning?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Video eLearning is a completely customizable method of eLearning development that offers flexibility to each learner and the company. This learning solution combines a stellar explanatory script, visually-engaging graphic animation, and a presentation method that grabs focus… and keeps it. Labeled by some experts as the most effective learning solution on the market, video eLearning offers affordability, speed, and target objective achievement – faster than traditional learning methods.\\r\\n\\r\\nSay goodbye to the added costs of travel to a training room and an entire classroom of people accumulating a full shift of unproductive time – and offer team members the opportunity to learn on their own terms and in their own time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":947,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Our Work\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAnimation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 image-hover\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":949,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Walkme\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":950,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":951,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clinico Path</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Character Animation + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Award-winning teacher at the Mayo Clinic and published author, Dr. Philip Tisdall, MD, had a massive task to achieve. The Clinico Path Group hoped to create whiteboard video training instructing students to use critical reasoning when caring for their patients. With hundreds of 40-minute lectures to morph into stunning and captivating video modules, Dr. Tisdall reached out to the pros at Ninja Tropic. He has been immersing his pathology students in these unique eLearning videos every month since.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Illustrative Minimalist + Illustrative Animation</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical educators know it’s important to keep up with the times. That’s why it’s important to offer only the best learning resources for medical professionals. In fact, new educational methods, like elearning video animation, have the potential to increase student engagement and understanding. This is what made Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi seek out NinjaTropic’s help. Dr. Yabrodi wanted to lead the charge for more innovative learning solutions in the medical field.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego zoo reached out to Ninja Tropic experts to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":953,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/VTS_Our-case-studies-486x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-953\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got just a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? Busy schedules demand condensed learning, and that’s what Ninja Tropic’s microlearning solutions offer!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":955,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Video-Animation-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-955\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Video Animation</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Are your learners struggling to grasp key company info or lacking process expertise? Video animation is the solution to boring lectures, enhancing engagement and delivering messages effectively!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18  et_pb_text_align_justified et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAre you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-autosave-v1','','','2026-03-13 03:55:37','2026-03-13 03:55:37','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=852',0,'revision','',0),(853,1,'2026-03-12 03:46:42','2026-03-12 03:46:42','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:46:42','2026-03-12 03:46:42','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=853',0,'revision','',0),(854,1,'2026-03-12 03:47:53','2026-03-12 03:47:53','','The-LMS-implementation-process_Mesa-de-trabajo-1_Mesa-de-trabajo-1','','inherit','open','closed','','the-lms-implementation-process_mesa-de-trabajo-1_mesa-de-trabajo-1','','','2026-03-12 03:47:53','2026-03-12 03:47:53','',369,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/The-LMS-implementation-process_Mesa-de-trabajo-1_Mesa-de-trabajo-1.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(855,1,'2026-03-12 03:47:58','2026-03-12 03:47:58','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEducational Training Video Production Done Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Video Training Strategy | Video Elearning and Video Animation Company.','','inherit','closed','closed','','369-revision-v1','','','2026-03-12 03:47:58','2026-03-12 03:47:58','',369,'http://localhost:8080/?p=855',0,'revision','',0),(856,1,'2026-03-12 03:50:43','2026-03