zed and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">For larger teams, we offer team support for additional support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Hiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost. Additionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners. Ninjatropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1034,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Outsourced LMS Administration Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"With our LMS Admin Services, you’ll have a dedicated LMS administrator \\u0026amp; team member, backed by a team of experts, ready to answer your calls, chats, and emails, ensuring your team’s needs are always met.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1036,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What does your <em>LMS administration entail</em>?</strong><br></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our expert team can handle almost all LMS administrator tasks, allowing you to focus on your core business.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOptimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Optimize \\u0026amp; Manage LMS\\r\\nWe’ll make sure your LMS runs smoothly, building SOPS and helping you get the most out of your platform’s features\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1001,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eStreamline your training program\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We can create and manage learning paths, ensuring your training programs are organized and effective.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1044,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eUser Management and Content Management\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We will handle user enrollment, course updates, and other content-related tasks, saving you valuable time.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1046,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReporting \\u0026amp; LMS configuration\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Need detailed reports? We can set up custom reports and ensure your LMS settings are optimized for your needs.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1000,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eAmazing Support from a dedicated team – check reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Have a question or run into a problem? Our team is available to help, so you’re never left in the dark.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1048,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Reduce <em>Administrative</em> Pressure</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Our expert team can handle almost all LMS administrator tasks, allowing you to focus on your core business.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>🔸 Time and resource savings</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Free up your team to focus on creating great learning experiences, not managing the system. By outsourcing your LMS administration, you reduce the need for extensive in-house training and free up valuable staff time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Flexibility and scalability</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our services can easily adapt to your changing needs, whether you’re a small business or a large organization. As your organization grows, we can scale our services to match, ensuring consistent support and management.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Expertise and knowledge</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our LMS experts stay on top of the latest trends and best practices, ensuring your platform is always optimized for performance and user experience. We handle the complexities of LMS management, so you don’t have to.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 Continuous support</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re here for you every step of the way, offering ongoing support and guidance. Whether you have a quick question or need assistance with a complex issue, our team is available during business hours to provide prompt and reliable support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong><strong>Platforms <em>We Support</em></strong></strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Ninja Tropic’s LMS Admin Services support a wide range of platforms to meet the diverse needs of our clients.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Customer LMS Vendor:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>LearnWorlds</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Thinkific</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TalentLMS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Absorb LMS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /w