45','2026-03-16 05:03:45','',385,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1063',0,'revision','',0),(1064,1,'2026-03-16 05:04:48','2026-03-16 05:04:48','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLMS Management Services: Unlimited Support\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Are you tired of juggling the complexities of your Learning Management System (LMS)? Do you wish you could focus more on creating engaging learning experiences and less on technical troubleshooting? With Ninja Tropic’s LMS Management Services, you can! We offer unlimited support to streamline your LMS and empower your team.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1059,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Management Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"What does LMS management entail? It’s more than just keeping the lights on. It involves:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSystem Administration:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Ensuring your LMS is up-to-date, secure, and running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eUser Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Handling user accounts, enrollments, and permissions.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eCourse Creation \\u0026amp; Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Developing, uploading, and updating course content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eReport