uickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Both plans come with unlimited support and a fixed monthly fee, so you can budget with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->','LMS Management Services: The Challenge of Filling the LMS Role','','inherit','closed','closed','','385-revision-v1','','','2026-03-16 05:07:31','2026-03-16 05:07:31','',385,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1066',0,'revision','',0),(1067,1,'2026-03-16 05:07:49','2026-03-16 05:07:49','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eLMS Management Services: Unlimited Support\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699