mundane and time-consuming task of LMS administration. It’s a crucial role, but it’s customer service-oriented and requires simple niche technical skills. Does this sound familiar? If so, you’re not alone.\\r\\n\\r\\nMany growing organizations face the challenge of managing a shrinking full-time employee (FTE) budget and need to keep their key staff on tasks that provide greater value, such as content creation and curriculum planning.\\r\\n\\r\\nAssigning the LMS admin role to an already busy team member, or limiting them to more value-added tasks, is a common scenario. It’s a role that is simple but important, one that must be delegated.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>LMS Admin <em>Services Plans</em></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer two flexible plans to fit your needs:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Standard Plan:</strong>&nbsp;Includes comprehensive LMS administration, user management, course loading, and basic reporting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Power Plan:</strong>&nbsp;Adds advanced course editing and development, custom reporting, and priority support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Both plans come with unlimited support and a fixed monthly fee, so you can budget with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"ninja-pricing-table container\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table ninja-pricing-table container\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Feature</strong></th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Standard Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$1,850</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">Up to 3000 Learners</span>\n    </th><th>\n      <span class=\"plan-name\">Power Unlimited Plan</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-price\">$2,875</span>\n      <span class=\"plan-limit\">3000+ Learners</span>\n    </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>LMS Administration</strong></td><td>Unlimited access to experienced LMS administrators during business hours, ensuring your system runs smoothly and efficiently.</td><td>Includes all Standard features plus integrated LMS administration with content editing support.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Loading</strong></td><td>Quick and accurate course uploads, keeping your content accessible and up-to-date.</td><td>Load and customize courses as needed, ensuring they stay relevant and engaging.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Management</strong></td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td><td>Manage user roles, access, and progress tracking with ease.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Routine Reporting</strong></td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td><td>In-depth analytics and custom reports to fine-tune your training programs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Proactive System Development</strong></td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues.</td><td>Routine maintenance and updates to keep your LMS optimized and reduce technical issues. Course edits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Advanced Troubleshooting</strong></td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions. 4 business hour response</td><td>Quick resolution of any technical issues to minimize disruptions.4 business hour response</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Articulate Storyline Production</strong></td><td>Minimal Editing, File Adjustment</td><td>Full support for developing and editing courses in Articulate products</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Editing (Storyline, SCORM)</strong></td><td></td><td>Quickly update or modify courses to keep content current and effective.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Enhanced Responsiveness</strong></td><td>Fast responses to support queries during business hours.</td><td>Priority support and dedicated resources for critical issues.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Both plans come with unlimited support and a fixed monthly fee, so you can budget with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary Comparison\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_6 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_13  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost.\\r\\n\\r\\nAdditionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content. If you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_7 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_10  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1070,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Roles and Responsibilities\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"LMS administrators play a vital role in the success of your learning programs. They are responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSystem Configuration:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Setting up and maintaining the LMS environment.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eUser Support:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Assisting learners and instructors with technical issues.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eContent Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Uploading and organizing courses, materials, and resources.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eData Analysis:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Tracking learner progress and identifying areas for improvement.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring and training an in-house LMS administrator can be costly and time-consuming. Outsourcing this role to Ninja Tropic is a cost-effective and efficient solution.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1071,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','LMS Management Services: The Challenge of Filling the LMS Role','','inherit','closed','closed