p:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading py-3\"><strong>Benefits of <em>Digital Onboarding</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our Digital Onboarding offers numerous benefits for both new hires and organizations. In the context of eLearning, it provides several key advantages:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Increased efficiency:</strong><br>Digital onboarding streamlines the onboarding process, reducing paperwork and administrative tasks. This allows new hires to focus on learning and development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Improved accessibility:</strong></strong><br>ELearning modules can be accessed anytime, anywhere, providing flexibility for new hires to learn at their own pace. This is especially beneficial for remote or hybrid work environments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Enhanced engagement:</strong></strong> <br>Interactive eLearning experiences can make the onboarding process more engaging and memorable. This can help new hires feel more connected to the organization and its culture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Improved knowledge retention:</strong><br>ELearning often incorporates multimedia elements, such as videos and simulations, which can enhance learning and retention. This ensures that new hires are equipped with the necessary knowledge and skills to succeed in their roles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Cost-effective:</strong><br>Digital onboarding can be more cost-effective than traditional methods, as it eliminates the need for physical training materials and travel expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBest Tools for Digital \\u003cem\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our customized onboarding modules act as a central hub, guiding new hires through the process with interactive modules, informative videos, and essential resources. We streamline LMS administration, making it easy to deliver and track onboarding progress. Our microlearning approach ensures content is easily digestible and engaging, maximizing knowledge retention.\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4 my-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eDigital Employee Onboarding in Tech Companies\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"The fast-paced world of tech demands an onboarding process that’s both efficient and engaging. Ninja Tropic understands the unique challenges of tech companies and tailors our solutions to meet your specific needs. We create onboarding experiences that quickly immerse new hires in your company culture and equip them with the skills and knowledge needed to hit the ground running. From role-specific training to compliance modules, we ensure your new employees are productive from day one.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1149,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eImplementing a Digital Employee Onboarding Strategy\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"A successful digital onboarding strategy requires careful planning and execution. Ninja Tropic is your partner every step of the way. We’ll help you assess your needs, design a tailored strategy, implement it seamlessly, and provide ongoing support to ensure its effectiveness. Our instructional design expertise guarantees an engaging and impactful experience that leaves a lasting impression on your new hires. With Ninja Tropic, you can rest assured that your onboarding process is optimized for success.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1151,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Employee Onboarding Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','409-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 15:48:27','2026-03-21 15:48:27','',409,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1153',0,'revision','',0),(1155,1,'2026-03-21 15:51:29','2026-03-21 15:51:29','','EO_OW_DESK_1','','inherit','open','closed','','eo_ow_desk_1','','','2026-03-21 15:51:29','2026-03-21 15:51:29','',409,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/EO_OW_DESK_1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1156,1,'2026-03-21 15:52:28','2026-03-21 15:52:28','','EO_OW_DESK_2','','inherit','open','closed','','eo_ow_desk_2','','','2026-03-21 15:52:28','2026-03-21 15:52:28','',409,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/EO_OW_DESK_2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1157,1,'2026-03-21 15:52:58','2026-03-21 15:52:58','','EO_OW_DESK_3','','inherit','open','closed','','eo_ow_desk_3','','','2026-03-21 15:52:58','2026-03-21 15:52:58','',409,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/EO_OW_DESK_3.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1158,1,'2026-03-21 15:53:04','2026-03-21 15:53:04','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eDigital Employee Onboarding Solutions: Engaging eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"It’s exciting to bring new members to the team but the sheer amount of employee onboarding can be overwhelming for any training leader. Corporate core values, employee benefits, and social-type training are just the tip of the iceberg.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn-person onboarding training can be a bit dull (and sucks up a tremendous amount of productive time). Combat employee onboarding training fatigue, make them feel welcome and encourage a connection with the company through interactive visual eLearning for your next onboarding session\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1074,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eHarnessing the Power of Digital Employee Onboarding\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"New hires are the future of any organization. They bring fresh ideas and energy. The first impression matters. Digital employee onboarding sets the stage for success. Ninja Tropic understands this. We help you craft a seamless onboarding experience through effective eLearning training.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Digital Employee Onboarding?\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Digital employee onboarding is the process of welcoming new employees into an organization using technology. It involves providing necessary information, training, and resources to help new hires quickly become productive members of the team.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining online creates the first experience any any new hire. It allows new employees to learn at their own pace and access information whenever they need it. This can be especially helpful for remote or hybrid work environments.\\r\\n\\r\\nSpeeding up employees ready for production is a key goal of digital onboarding. By providing targeted training and resources, new hires can learn essential skills and knowledge more efficiently. This can reduce the time it takes for them to become fully productive contributors to the organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1120,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Give Your <em>New Hires</em> a Best-in-Class Experience</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We make onboarding exciting. We know first impressions matter. That’s why we focus on creating interactive eLearning experiences that resonate with new hires.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our eLearning courses are designed to make learning easy. We break down complex information into bite-sized lessons, making it simple for new employees to grasp and retain key knowledge.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our video training production team brings onboarding to life. We create dynamic and informative videos that help new employees quickly understand their role within the organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We cover a wide range of topics – from compliance training to leadership development. We also offer instructional design strategy consultations to help you create a comprehensive and effective onboarding program that aligns with your organizational goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Partner with Ninja Tropic and give your new hires the best possible start. We’ll create a digital onboarding experience that fosters a sense of belonging, accelerates learning, and sets your employees up for success from day one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"8rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:8rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container ninja-sticky-columns\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container ninja-sticky-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"ninja-sticky-column\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ninja-sticky-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"py-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading py-3\"><strong>Benefits of <em>Digital Onboarding</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our Digital Onboarding offers numerous benefits for both new hires and organizations. In the context of eLearning, it provides several key advantages:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Increased efficiency:</strong><br>Digital onboarding streamlines the onboarding process, reducing paperwork and administrative tasks. This allows new hires to focus on learning and development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Improved accessibility:</strong></strong><br>ELearning modules can be accessed anytime, anywhere, providing flexibility for new hires to learn at their own pace. This is especially beneficial for remote or hybrid work environments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Enhanced engagement:</strong></strong> <br>Interactive eLearning experiences can make the onboarding process more engaging and memorable. This can help new hires feel more connected to the organization and its culture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Improved knowledge retention:</strong><br>ELearning often incorporates multimedia elements, such as videos and simulations, which can enhance learning and retention. This ensures that new hires are equipped with the necessary knowledge and skills to succeed in their roles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Cost-effective:</strong><br>Digital onboarding can be more cost-effective than traditional methods, as it eliminates the need for physical training materials and travel expenses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBest Tools for Digital \\u003cem\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our customized onboarding modules act as a central hub, guiding new hires through the process with interactive modules,