s about skill mastery. Employees must demonstrate they can apply what they’ve learned before progressing.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis approach benefits organizations because it ensures employees gain practical, job-ready skills. It also benefits learners by providing personalized, self-paced learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt Ninja Tropic eLearning, we structure training to reinforce knowledge retention and skill application. Our courses integrate real world scenarios, making learning engaging, efficient, and impactful.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1171,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Deliver <em>Competency-Based</em> Training to Your Team, Right to Their Smartphones</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modern learners demand accessibility. Employees don’t want to sit in a classroom for hours. They need training that fits into their work schedules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That’s why&nbsp;<strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning</strong>&nbsp;delivers&nbsp;<strong>mobile-friendly, bite-sized training</strong>. Your team can learn anytime, anywhere—right from their smartphones or tablets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸<strong>Microlearning Modules:</strong><br>Short, engaging lessons that fit into a busy workday.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactive Scenarios:</strong><br>Simulated experiences that reinforce skills</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>On-Demand Learning:</strong><br>Employees can revisit content whenever they need a refresher.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Gamification:</strong><br>Rewards and challenges that keep learners engaged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1172,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"500px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/LP-Custom-Competency-Based-Training-Solutions-Award-Winning_2-576x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1172\" style=\"width:auto;height:500px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><em>Competency-Based</em> Training Examples</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wondering what competency-based training looks like? Here are examples of how we bring learning to life –&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-portfolio/\">Check out our Portfolio with 100s of examples and case studies!&nbsp;</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sales Training</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"