on\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1205,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhy You Need a \\u003cem\\u003eSales Enablement \\u003c/em\\u003ePlan\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your current sales team may be comprised of a few top performers and some who may need more time to learn the ropes. Effective sales enablement training gets those newbies and average-performers learning and implementing the new information quickly – improving their performance while limiting time away from their revenue-generating role.\\r\\n\\r\\nA great sales training strategy helps organizations crush their goals, achieve their mission, and drive a high-achieving sales culture among the team which is exactly what sales success looks like.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Create a Training and Enablement Program Rooted in Performance</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Well-rounded training and enablement programs not only teach your sales reps how to sell, but it also informs them of the sales process as a whole. When they understand where customers come from and where they’re headed after the sales conversation, they’ll better guide those clients through the buyer’s journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With an effective sales enablement program, your team will feel supported and ready to take on anything that comes their way – a new product, new resources, and new customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>The Crucial Difference Between Sales Enablement &amp; Sales Training</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sure, you can teach your team the script and the rebuttals, but more than sales training is required. With a sales enablement strategy and program, sales training can transition into something much more valuable. Each training module builds upon the next, demonstrating how to use the knowledge and resources to their advantage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ditch the old “how-tos” of sales training and grow your learners into a sales enablement program.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur Approach to Sales Enablement\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"An off-the-shelf or basic sales enablement training program isn’t going to cut it. We understand… and that’s why we develop bespoke or custom video-based sales enablement modules designed specifically for your organization and your team.\\r\\n\\r\\nIntegrating your brand, your distinct processes, and your one-of-a-kind structure, our approach to sales enablement is personal.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1215,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Sales Enablement Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The N2 Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1220,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Salesboosy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1219,\"_ite