39f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":936,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\r\\n\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nOnboarding is more than just training. It’s about building connections and a sense of belonging. Make onboarding engaging and memorable with interactive eLearning.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ready to Transform [gradient]Your Training[/gradient]?\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Patient Education Videos That Boost Compliance','','inherit','closed','closed','','427-autosave-v1','','','2026-03-21 21:24:35','2026-03-21 21:24:35','',427,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1280',0,'revision','',0),(1282,1,'2026-03-21 20:36:15','2026-03-21 20:36:15','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCustom Healthcare Training Solutions – Bespoke eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Training your staff effectively is critical to delivering quality care. Whether you’re onboarding new employees or upskilling seasoned professionals, the right training can bridge knowledge gaps and improve patient outcomes. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we specialize in creating custom healthcare training solutions that resonate with modern learners, leveraging video and interactive eLearning to engage your team and deliver measurable results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1249,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eHealthcare Training Solutions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Healthcare training is more than just compliance. It’s about empowering your team to provide better care and adapt to the ever-evolving landscape of medical advancements. Our custom eLearning solutions are designed to help you achieve your training goals while making the learning experience enjoyable and effective. With our expertise, we turn complex medical content into engaging training modules that are easy to understand and apply in real-world scenarios.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training program your staff actually looks forward to. That’s the Ninja Tropic difference.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Creative Medical Education &amp; Training Solutions</strong></strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The healthcare industry demands precision, empathy, and continuous learning. At <strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning</strong>, we tailor creative medical education solutions to address the specific needs of your organization while delivering measurable outcomes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What sets our approach apart:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Visual Learning:</strong><br>High-quality video, animation, and simulations break down complex medical procedures into digestible, actionable steps. Research shows that visual learners retain <strong>55% more information</strong> when content is video-based.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Interactivity:</strong><br>Hands-on activities like decision-making scenarios and virtual patient simulations enhance engagement and knowledge retention. Interactive training has been shown to improve performance by <strong>20%</strong> compared to traditional methods.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 <strong>Storytelling:</strong><br>Relatable, scenario-based narratives make content memorable and impactful. Studies indicate that storytelling can improve learner retention by up to <strong>22%</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By combining these strategies, we ensure your team isn’t just informed but fully equipped to apply their knowledge with confidence. These measurable improvements lead to better patient outcomes, reduced errors, and increased team efficiency.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1262,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"800px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Patient-Education-Materials-Our-Process-980x1551-1-647x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1262\" style=\"width:auto;height:800px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Custom Healthcare Training Solutions','','inherit','closed','closed','','429-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 20:36:15','2026-03-21 20:36:15','',429,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1282',0,'revision','',0),(1283,1,'2026-03-21 20:36:36','2026-03-21 20:36:36','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCustom Healthcare Training Solutions – Bespoke eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Training your staff effectively is critical to delivering quality care. Whether you’re onboarding new employees or upskilling seasoned professionals, the right training can bridge knowledge gaps and improve patient outcomes. At Ninja Tropic eLearning, we