ount of product training content. That’s exactly what we provide. Microlearning for the on-demand skills essential for personal, product, and company success.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_section_regular\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>What are the Key Benefits Of <em>Product Knowledge Training</em>?</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fit\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->\n<p><strong>Investing in product knowledge training offers numerous benefits for your business.</strong>&nbsp;It empowers your team to become product experts, boosting sales, enhancing customer satisfaction, and improving team morale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Boost Sales</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work closely with you to identify your specific safety training needs, including your target audience, training objectives, regulatory requirements, and budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Happy Customers:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Fewer Returns:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Empowered teams close more deals.<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Efficient Onboarding:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New hires get up to speed faster.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Increased Customer Satisfaction:</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When teams are knowledgeable about products, they can provide better support and assistance, leading to happier customers who are more likely to return and recommend your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">🔸 <strong><strong>Improved Team Morale:</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Investing in training shows employees that their development is valued, boosting morale and motivation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><strong><em>Ninja Tropic eLearning</em></strong>&nbsp;can help you achieve these benefits and more. Our expert team will work with you to create tailored product knowledge training programs that meet your specific needs.<br><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Different Types Of Product Knowledge Training for Different Teams</strong><br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSales Teams\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"Product knowledge training can help sales teams close more deals by equipping them with the tools to effectively address customer concerns and present the product’s value proposition.\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1330,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4 class=\\u0022et_pb_module_header\\u0022\\u003eMarketing Teams:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nProduct knowledge training can help marketing teams develop more effective messaging and positioning strategies by understanding the product’s unique features and benefits.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1330,\"_icon\":\"field_69bf0fd2c717b\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_69bf0fdcc717c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:acf/icon-card {\"name\":\"acf/icon-card\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eCustomer Service:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69bf0facc7179\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_7 modulo-mas\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_12 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nProduct knowledge training can help customer service teams provide exceptional support by mastering troubleshooting techniques, handling inquiries efficiently, and understanding the product’s intricacies.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69bf0fbfc717a\",\"icon\":1330,\"_icon\":\"field_6