 cannot be left to a boring, traditional slide deck. When effective training is crucial to employees being able to do their job well – it’s time to evolve in the way you educate them. Video-based eLearning aligns with employee preferences and attention to ensure each team member’s technical procedural mastery.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1376,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1378,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Technical-Training-2_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-960x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1378\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Advantages of Technical Training</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bullet points and still images don’t offer the 65% majority of visual learners a true demonstration of technical processes. Animated, visually-focused specialized training reaches employees faster and more effectively while seeing how the procedure is performed and applying that knowledge. When was the last time you were able to follow a complex set of process steps without seeing it done? Exactly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not to mention, operational cost savings are often associated with extensive on-the-job instruction. This is where a robust technical learning procedure comes into play.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Technical Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','433-revision-v1','','','2026-03-21 22:41:14','2026-03-21 22:41:14','',433,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1381',0,'revision','',0),(1382,1,'2026-03-21 22:41:33','2026-03-21 22:41:33','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInteractive Technical Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Technical learning processes, step-by-step procedures, and complex undertakings that are integral to a company’s bottom line cannot be left to a boring, traditional slide deck. When effective training is crucial to employees being able to do their job well – it’s time to evolve in the way you educate them. Video-based eLearning aligns with employee preferences and attention to ensure each team member’s technical procedural mastery.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1376,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1378,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Technical-Training-2_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-281x300.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1378\"/></figure>\n<!