\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Protect Your Business with <em>CyberSecurity Training</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a world of remote work, there are a slew of risks for organizations including phishing, weak network security, social engineering, and compromised passwords. Prepare your business for any potential attacks with a high-level of education for every employee, contractor, and intern.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Humans are both fallible and valuable so make sure they are your shield of protection against devastating cyber attacks with engaging video-based cybersecurity awareness training that includes:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 How to stay safe from threats while working remotely<br>🔸 Password creation tips<br>🔸 How to spot and report phishing attempts<br>🔸 Installing a firewall to block shady websites<br>🔸 Protecting your emails with an automatic spam blocker</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of<em> Cybersecurity Training</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cybersecurity training offers the confidence your employees need to work with conviction and control over their own projects without the fear of catastrophic risk and vulnerabilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply knowing what to look for and how to report it within your organization gives them the tools they need and the knowledge they seek to remain aware of potential cybersecurity risks – and make solid decisions on your behalf.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That means… You need solid cybersecurity training that excites your learners and visually speaks to them with content unique to your organization so – off the shelf products just aren’t going to cut it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong>Common <em>Digital Threats</em> for Businesses</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To protect your business and your customers, it’s crucial that leadership and employees alike can recognize common digital threats. Keep the following on your radar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Phishing<br>🔸 Whaling<br>🔸 Ransomware<br>🔸 Malware<br>🔸 Wi-Fi and Home Network Security<br>🔸 Password Policies<br>🔸 Email Security</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Ninja Tropic Cybersecurity Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Willis College\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1443,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"Drip 7 SANS\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1444,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"SANS\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":1445,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eSafety Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"In every work environment, safety is the top priority. Team members should return home safely. Engaging visuals and compelling explanations are key to capturing attention and ensuring knowledge retention.\\r\\n\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":1372,\"_sol