or {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s hard to check the boxes on whether or not someone has mastered soft skills because they are often thought of as “innate talents.” However, with adequate instruction and continual practice, we believe that soft skills training can be learned and perfected over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If not, imagine the lack of awesome sales team members, customer service employees, and collaborative in-house teams that get things done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Soft Skills Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','453-revision-v1','','','2026-03-22 00:10:17','2026-03-22 00:10:17','',453,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1484',0,'revision','',0),(1486,1,'2026-03-22 00:11:28','2026-03-22 00:11:28','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eBest Diversity \\u0026 Inclusion Training eLearning Company\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Diversity, equity, and inclusion training is an integral piece of education that benefits every employee at every corporation but developing it can feel overwhelming and confusing. How do you ensure that every team member feels represented and included? You hire the pros.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic is an award-winning video-based education development and consulting company that has perfected the art of DEI training development and delivery to make sure your team understands what diversity, equity, and inclusion mean, how to integrate crucial behaviors and mentalities into daily operations and produce the best of the best from every single human.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1450,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is <em>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion</em> Training</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to understand how diversity, equity, and inclusion fit into your company, it’s essential to define each.<br>Diversity describes the things or characteristics that make people awesomely different from others, varied in talents and experience, and just who they are as a human. It could include things like gender, sexual orientation, ethnicity, age, religion, socioeconomic status, disability, and veteran status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equity is often confused with equality (which means treating everyone equally) but is a bit different in its definition. Equity refers to ensuring that every person during the hiring process and daily operations of the company – begins at the same starting line.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It removes existing barriers. For example, a wheelchair handicapable person cannot perform their best if offered a standard desk height and the walkways within the company are not wide enough for a wheelchair to comfortably travel the office. In short, equity is fairness, justice, and impartiality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Inclusion expresses a welcoming environment for all which promotes each team member to feel comfortable sharing their ideas, contributions, and gifts with support and respect. Without inclusion, employees may not feel valued and do not offer their best during collaborative assignments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>DEI training instructs all members of the team to treat others in accordance with these key behaviors to ensure a great working environment for all, a top-shelf level of productivity, and a reduced attrition rate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1452,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/WHAT-IS-DIVERSITY-2-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1452\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhy You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why You Need DEI Training in the Workplace\\r\\nNot only does an inclusive and culturally diverse workplace create that positive working environment for all team members, when each employee feels valued, it attracts high-quality talent, provides equal opportunities for everyone, and motivates each human to perform at their very best with innovative ideas and a higher productivity rate.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe most effective way to achieve those goals is relatable diversity, equity, and inclusion training that appeals to the emotional connection of people. If you’re not sure where to begin in developing your DEI training, look no further. We’ve got your back.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1458,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OUR-APPROACH-3-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1458\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><em>Our Approach</em> to Diversity Training Services</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We ask the tough questions, get to the root of your unique perspective, and work tirelessly to customize a DEI training program that exceeds every expectation because that’s what we do. We see employees as humans and not as numbers on a spreadsheet and when it comes to diversity, equity, and inclusion training, you need a professional to appeal to the human factor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’re not here to talk about awards (we’ve got a LOT of them), or how awesomely talented our team is (they are), but we understand that our clients are putting a lot of responsibility in our hands. Our experience will show for itself.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Diversity Training \\u0026 Inclusion Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"View Case Studie\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1461,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/related-solutions {\"name\":\"acf/related-solutions\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eRelated \\u003cem\\u003eSolutions\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69b76e87c539d\",\"solution_0_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eTechnical Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_0_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_0_description\":\"Technical training involves complex steps and interconnected processes to master productivity. Leave the hard stuff to us! Stunning graphics and engaging voice promote lasting learning retention.\",\"_solution_0_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_0_image\":643,\"_solution_0_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_0_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_0_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_1_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eProduct Training\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_1_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_1_description\":\"Sales teams need deep product knowledge to close deals. Effective training boosts sales, improves customer satisfaction, and increases ROI. Make training engaging, not a chore.\",\"_solution_1_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_1_image\":644,\"_solution_1_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_1_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_1_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution_2_title\":\"\\u003ch4\\u003eEmployee Onboarding\\u003c/h4\\u003e\",\"_solution_2_title\":\"field_69b76ebbc539f\",\"solution_2_description\":\"Welcoming new team members is vital for retention, yet traditional onboarding can be outdated and boring. Show you value their growth with engaging animated eLearning modules that make a real impact!\",\"_solution_2_description\":\"field_69b76ecac53a0\",\"solution_2_image\":645,\"_solution_2_image\":\"field_69b76ed5c53a1\",\"solution_2_link\":{\"title\":\"Learn more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_solution_2_link\":\"field_69b76edfc53a2\",\"solution\":3,\"_solution\":\"field_69b76ea9c539e\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started With [gradient]Diversity Training Services[/gradient] for Employees\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Whether you employ 1 or 100,000 people, every business needs a strong cybersecurity training program to ensure your business stays protected, remains safe, and stays in business. One data breach could result in years of recovery and millions of dollars spent.\\r\\n\\r\\nContact Ninja Tropic to chat about your cybersecurity training for employees and let’s protect you and your life’s work.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Diversity And Inclusion Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','449-revision-v1','','','2026-03-22 00:11:28','2026-03-22 00:11:28','',449,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1486',0,'revision','',0),(1487,1,'2026-03-22 00:11:47','2026-03-22 00:11:47','','Rectangle-322-copia','','inherit','open','closed','','rectangle-322-copia','','','2026-03-22 00:11:47','2026-03-22 00:11:47','',453,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-322-copia.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(1488,1,'2026-03-22 00:11:51','2026-03-22 00:11:51','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eNinja Tropic: A Soft Skills Training Company for eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Communication is essential for every organization that serves customers or works in a collaborative environment and that means – you need solid soft skills training. Ninja Tropic, an award-winning development, coaching, and training service-providing company can take your team members’ soft skill development from awkward to awe-inspiring and amp up those sales numbers.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1479,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null,\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>What is <em>Soft Skills </em>Training</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Why Use <em>Soft Skills </em>Training in Your Company?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s hard to check the boxes on whether or not someone has mastered soft skills because they are often thought of as “innate talents.” However, with adequate instruction and continual practice, we believe that soft skills training can be learned and perfected over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If not, imagine the lack of awesome sales team members, customer service employees, and collaborative in-house teams that get things done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1487,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-322-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1487\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use<em> Soft Skills</em> Training for Employees in the Workplace</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Soft Skills Training','','inherit','closed','closed','','453-revision-v1','','','2026-03-22 00:11:51','2026-03-22 00:11:51','',453,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1488',0,'revision','',0),(1490,1,'2026-03-22 00:13:05','2026-03-22 00:13:05','','montaje-de-videos-de-web-vista-previa-16','','inherit','open','closed','','montaje-de-videos-de-web-vista-previa-16','','','2026-03-22 00:13:05','2026-03-22 00:13:05','',453,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/montaje-de-videos-de-web-vista-previa-16.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1491,1,'2026-03-22 00:13:07','2026-03-22 00:13:07','','asylum-01-980x1230','','inherit','open','closed','','asylum-01-980x1230','','','2026-03-22 00:13:07','2026-03-22 00:13:07','',453,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/asylum-01-980x1230-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1492,1,'2026-03-22 00:14:34','2026-03-22 00:14:34','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eTraining Simulation\\r\\nSoftware for eLearning\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.\\r\\n\\r\\nGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.\\r\\nCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat is Educational Simulation Software?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Taking a real-to-life software simulation and embedding it into training offers learners the experience of a practical approach without risk to the company. Making mistakes and finding success in a simulation-type environment offers a unique learning experience unmatched by traditional training methodology.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith such impeccable positive learning statistics measured with educational simulation software as a training technique, it’s a win-win for both the organization and its team members.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Use <em>Simulation Software</em> for Training &amp; Education</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether opting for an augmented or virtual reality experience, gamified simulation, or a simple test drive of the software in a video-based eLearning format, specific applications and methods are varied and should be more targeted to the unique type of software and systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Depending on the process from safety to tech, integrating hands-on experiences for your learners greatly increases content retention and in turn, the company’s success.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Virtual<br><em>Training and Simulation </em>Development</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The benefits of using virtual training and simulation training for your attendees are vast.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This learning and training practice allows for:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🔸 Improved confidence of the learner<br>🔸 Hands-on practice without risk<br>🔸 Increased safety and knowledge<br>🔸 True-to-life experiences<br>🔸 Immediate feedback without manual intervention to guide success<br>🔸 Gaining measurable success data and knowledge retention</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container-sm\">Training <em>Simulation Software</em><br>Portfolio &amp; Examples</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1474,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/PORTA_LexisNexis-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1474\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">LexisNexis</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1475,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"#\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Segment-1280x720-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1475\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Segment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"How to Get Started With Training Simulation Software for eLearning\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"It’s time to give your team members the training they need to hit the ground running when the new system or process is luanched internally with simulation training and Ninja Tropic has the best developers and artist in the field. Complete the form below so one of our knowledgeable staff can reach the right person and discuss exactly what you need to transorm your learning methods into something that sticks.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSimulation-Based Training FAQ’s\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\n🔸 How do i include simulation in eLearning training programs?\\r\\n\\r\\n🔸 What is simulation in eLearning?\\r\\n\\r\\n🔸 How much does eLearning simulation software cost?\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Software Simulation','','inherit','closed','closed','','451-autosave-v1','','','2026-03-22 00:14:34','2026-03-22 00:14:34','',451,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1492',0,'revision','',0),(1493,1,'2026-03-22 00:14:47','2026-03-22 00:14:47','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eNinja Tropic: A Soft Skills Training Company for eLearning\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Communication is essential for every organization that serves customers or works in a collaborative environment and that means – you need solid soft skills training. Ninja Tropic, an award-winning development, coaching, and training service-providing company can take your team members’ soft skill development from awkward to awe-inspiring and amp up those sales numbers.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1479,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"0px\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"2rem\"}}} -->\n<div style=\"height:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":null,\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>What is <em>Soft Skills </em>Training</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Why Use <em>Soft Skills </em>Training in Your Company?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s hard to check the boxes on whether or not someone has mastered soft skills because they are often thought of as “innate talents.” However, with adequate instruction and continual practice, we believe that soft skills training can be learned and perfected over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If not, imagine the lack of awesome sales team members, customer service employees, and collaborative in-house teams that get things done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1487,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-322-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1487\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use<em> Soft Skills</em> Training for Employees in the Workplace</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat Are the Benefits of Soft Skill Development?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Soft skills training is an impactful way to build solid, positive relationships both internally and with clientele. I can nudge people outside their comfort zones, where the magic happens and innovation lives while strengthening their interpersonal skills to create a strategy for raking in the profit.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Soft Skills Development Training Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Cornerstone Foundation\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1490,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"AsylumWorks\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":1491,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"CUNA\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":949,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started With Soft Skill Training \\u0026 Development\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ninja Tropic is a leading, award-winning video-based training development company that also specializes in custom soft skills training creation, learning and development coaching, and learning consultation services. Your one-stop-shop for all bespoke learning because when it’s tailored to exactly what you need, it’s just better (and more effective).\\r\\n\\r\\nReach out today and let’s chat about what you need and how we can introduce soft skills training with an impact on your existing learning and development curriculum.\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-hei