separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Why Use <em>Soft Skills </em>Training in Your Company?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s hard to check the boxes on whether or not someone has mastered soft skills because they are often thought of as “innate talents.” However, with adequate instruction and continual practice, we believe that soft skills training can be learned and perfected over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If not, imagine the lack of awesome sales team members, customer service employees, and collaborative in-house teams that get things done.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container-sm mt-4\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container-sm mt-4\"><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1487,\"aspectRatio\":\"4/3\",\"scale\":\"contain\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Rectangle-322-copia.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1487\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How to Use<em> Soft Skills</em> Training for Employees in the Workplace</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase how soft skills training will simply and powerfully change team members’ lives. Appealing to their hearts and souls (and minds) is one way to get them on board with improving their soft skills and dedication to continual improvement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training can be taken individually and followed up with some in-depth discussion about current strengths, weaknesses, and implementation of newly learned content. Training soft skills can seem like a challenge, but when the benefits are laid out, the training is easy to attend and comprehend, and the implementation tactics build upon one another, your team will be more apt to include the skills in their everyday lives – on and off the clock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-6\\u0022\\u003eWhat Are the Benefits of Soft Skill Development?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Soft skills training is an impactful way to build solid, positive relationships both internally and with clientele. I can nudge people outside their comfort zones, where the magic happens and innovation lives while strengthening their interpersonal skills to create a strategy for raking in the profit.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Soft Skills Development Training Case Studies\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"Cornerstone Foundation\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":1490,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_it