Excellence</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From healthcare to corporate training, our award-winning work spans every industry and learning format.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1545,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Top-eLearning-Content-Providers-2024_Cyan-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1545\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2024</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Top eLearning Content Provider<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Top eLearning Content Provider<br>For four consecutive years, we have been recognized as Top eLearning Providers by eLearning Industry. We are honored and thrilled to continue supporting companies in training and developing their internal and external teams.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1549,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2023_dha_winner_print_copia-980x814-1-150x150.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1549\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2023</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Digital Health Awards Winner<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">We are honored to announce that we have been recognized and awarded in the prestigious 2023 Digital Health Awards. Categories such as content, design, creativity, and user experience were taken into account, ensuring that only the most exceptional solutions earned a place at the top.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1550,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/INMOBI2023-980x692-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1550\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2023</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Gold – Learning &amp; Development<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">We won Gold in the Learning and Development category from Brandon Hall in 2023. We are honored by this award and proud of our contributions to the medical industry and patient education. Our commitment to supporting the eLearning industry remains unwavering.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mb-6\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mb-6\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1563,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/INMOBI2023-980x692-2-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1563\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\"><em><strong>2022</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Best Learning &amp; Development Program<br></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size\">Gold in Best L&amp;D category for developing an Interactive Mobile Marketing Training Program generating $4M in deals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"ninja-box ninja-box\\u002d\\u002dhover-border py-4 px-2\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column ninja-box ninja-box--hover-border py-4 px-2\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1564,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"al