0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCustom eLearning Solutions Built for Associations\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We get it. Association education teams face unique challenges. You need to deliver high-quality training to diverse audiences, often with limited budgets and tight deadlines. You’re juggling member engagement, certification programs, and maybe even expanding new revenue streams through new online courses.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic eLearning is here to help. We specialize in creating custom eLearning solutions for associations just like yours. We understand your need for engaging, effective online learning that meets your specific goals and resonates with your members. Our deep roots in the nonprofit and association space have given us a unique understanding of the challenges and opportunities facing these organizations.\\r\\n\\r\\n Over 70% of our end learners are external, and our clients love us because of our key focus on delivering effective, scalable learning experiences that engage, educate, and inspire.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1584,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->','Associations','','inherit','closed','closed','','474-revision-v1','','','2026-03-29 17:48:13','2026-03-29 17:48:13','',474,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1585',0,'revision','',0),(1587,1,'2026-03-29 17:51:11','2026-03-29 17:51:11','<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eCreate True Business Impact\\r\\n\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Creating a buzz around your nonprofit association or your cause (or attracting donors to support it) can be a challenge when passing out flyers, taking out an ad in the local newspaper, or posting on social media. Getting a few viewers at a time just isn’t enough.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith the ever-diminishing attention span of adults worldwide, it’s crucial to grab and keep attention while educating the public about your mission. The answer: interactive and animated video-based modules.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1583,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Contact us\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>We get it.</strong>&nbsp;Association education teams face unique challenges. You need to deliver high-quality training to diverse audiences, often with limited budgets and tight deadlines. You’re juggling member engagement, certification programs, and maybe even expanding new revenue streams through new online courses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Ninja Tropic eLearning is here to help.</strong>&nbsp;We specialize in creating custom eLearning solutions for associations just like yours. We understand your need for engaging, effective online learning that meets your specific goals and resonates with your members.&nbsp;<strong>Our deep roots in the nonprofit and association space have given us a unique understanding of the challenges and opportunities facing these organizations.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&nbsp;Over 70% of our end learners are external, and our clients love us because of our key focus on delivering effective, scalable learning experiences that engage, educate, and inspire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1584,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost: