nkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-12.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1731\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"className\":\"mb-3\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-3\"><strong>#2. Outline all required content</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Why are you making this video? Begin by brainstorming some basic questions, such as who your audience will be, what your learning objectives are, and why you are making this video. Making these goals clear at the beginning of your project will ensure you create a video that meets your training needs.<strong><br></strong><br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"mb-4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column mb-4\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1730,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ICON-Video-Training-Strategy_Mesa-de-trabajo-1-13.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1730\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"className\":\"mb-6\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-6 has-large-font-size\"><strong>#3. Select the style and format</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Which style and format is best for your video? Your video’s content, your audience, your desired branding, and many other factors will come into play when selecting both the 