ncepts, and make information more digestible for learners. Paired with an eLearning design that aligns with learners, it can help to make learning more interesting, interactive, and effective.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":\"\",\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Tools Moodboard Kynetic Typography','','inherit','closed','closed','','505-revision-v1','','','2026-04-05 22:29:10','2026-04-05 22:29:10','',505,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1897',0,'revision','',0),(1898,1,'2026-04-05 22:30:06','2026-04-05 22:30:06','<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":4,\"className\":\"custom-sidebar-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch1\\u003eKinetic Typography\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text