,'<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":4,\"className\":\"custom-sidebar-navigation\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Kid-Friendly Characters</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Is a design style that is commonly used in eLearning for children. It includes characters with rounded big eyes that children can easily relate to, as well as other iconography such as animals and objects. This style can be adapted from adult styles to suit children’s needs and age range. For this audience, the use of Kid-Friendly Characters can help to create a more engaging and fun learning experience for children. It can also be used to reinforce key concepts and ideas by making them more memorable and relatable. Kid-Friendly is a broad range! As you would expect, teenagers are very different from 3rd graders. We often adapt adult styles for this audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/821223911/e2c9a1a77d?fl=pl\\u0026fe=sh\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"vimeo\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<fi